{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0614_1000_p", "source_sha256": "08ca387da672c4d744b5e70cd42b6868023cfdb3634ba49e1b716bcbcf67f5c8", "ja": "（キャビンアテンダントをイメージした新衣装が\n完成した。亜利沙は、しきりに頷いている……）", "zh": "（以空乘人员为灵感设计的新服装完成了。亚利沙不停地点着头……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0614_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "aaf324e4a1ab88c159da0c9dc8e502d44c31d28d5b1597f0a2c2c15ef78d8944", "ja": "なるほどなるほど……。元になった制服の良さは\nそのままに、アイドルちゃんらしくアレンジ！", "zh": "原来如此，原来如此……保留作为灵感来源的制服优点，再加入偶像的风格进行改造！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0614_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "35a75e8f367fcbf364714db72cc51a19577981ac83d2cb34517e57a7c2edef29", "ja": "曲や歌詞の魅力も、デザインとして取り込んでいく。\nアイドルの衣装には、無限の可能性がありますね！", "zh": "将歌曲和歌词的魅力，也融入到设计之中。\n偶像的服装，蕴藏着无限的可能性呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0614_1003_p", "source_sha256": "3d2d5555cf81d6e40e82f7bf0c6a512c39c1d505fd5799c2fcb3b99f4d737c22", "ja": "さすが、よくわかってるな。アイドルの衣装は、\n言わば勝負服みたいなものだからな。", "zh": "不愧是你，真懂啊。偶像的服装，说白了就像是上场比赛时穿的战袍一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0614_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "b8cd0690ae3953afc9c7d1c5996445b330c3784d4e2c7ea60dbaa3075834a1e4", "ja": "勝負服……。そうですね。衣装が変われば、\nステージの……いえ、会場全体の空気が変わります。", "zh": "胜负服……确实如此。换上不同的服装，舞台上的……不，整个会场的气氛都会改变。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0614_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "5e36ed550381fc14e673996404c6892e05a4852ebdd87af08ef2e2f72fd0e6b9", "ja": "ライブという名のフライトをアテンドする\nアイドルちゃんたち……。", "zh": "负责接待这场名为演唱会的航班的偶像们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0614_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2369a6e7840357990dd484b7e8bd91bc9ad255e4a5a4bcf2081b560063dea006", "ja": "（この衣装を着るのは、亜利沙なんだけどな……）", "zh": "（可是穿这身衣服的明明是亚利沙啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0614_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "55f20159cc8c0ba5a272e929811a878d6ede105a8d9e9be8cacc60d5d911c26a", "ja": "ボルテージが最高潮のタイミングで、この衣装を着た\nアイドルちゃんが出てきたら……ふぉぉ！", "zh": "气氛达到最高潮的时候，要是穿着这套服装的偶像姑娘登场了……呜哦哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0614_1008_p", "source_sha256": "7befbaf42ea17b226cc77f90b02706a40bbbb2ff9d8a6ade54e29e0ba0e94822", "ja": "ははっ。その反応だけで、わかったよ。\nライブでも盛り上がりそうだな。", "zh": "哈哈。光看你的反应，我就明白了。  \n在演唱会上应该也会炒热气氛吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0614_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "7abd726c6f1f24c02b0f05d574d8d7e4d1ee59d52fb40159fa66d91596bea99a", "ja": "もちろんです、{$P$}さん！\nこれは、決して！　大げさではありませんっ！", "zh": "那是当然的，{$P$}先生！\n这绝——对！不是夸大其词！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0614_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "dcb0f29dbb248edc7bef95f9953274d18df1057e8e0ed959ec09e936df05c0b8", "ja": "アイドルちゃんは、いつもファンが楽しめるように\nいろいろなことを考えてくれてますよね？", "zh": "偶像们总是在为让粉丝开心而考虑各种各样的事情，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0614_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "b63c19ce687cf0e59b57535f644612587f5eac99252a4d55f0ffd16edca1beda", "ja": "それは飛行機の乗務員さんが、空の旅を楽しめるように\n気を配ってくれるのと同じだと思うんです。", "zh": "我觉得，这就像飞机上的乘务员为了让大家享受空中旅程，也会处处替大家着想一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0614_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d4f80cfbff9e4f56768bcdc9842ef3c7e1d66b662bdc9d6dfc39c29f46897b67", "ja": "確かに……。どちらの職業も、おもてなしのプロだな。\nということは、亜利沙も……？", "zh": "确实……。两种职业都是待客之道的专家呢。\n这么说来，亚利沙也……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0614_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "5fb31e0e4b2baf7f5ba9a1bcfc9d90e3d9cd2410f8c13a10269843b65d4eecdd", "ja": "お任せください！　……って言えたらよかったん\nですケド、難易度の高い挑戦になりそうな予感が……。", "zh": "请交给我吧！……要是能这么说就好了，不过总觉得这会是个难度很高的挑战……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0614_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "0fe44f31780525c19cc6213d21d48bef8e1bafd0e482c60b2efb1574bd3905c3", "ja": "この衣装に恥じない堂々とした姿で、ファンのみなさん\nを夢のような時間にお連れする、理想はあるんですが！", "zh": "我当然也有理想！那就是以不负这身服装的堂堂姿态，带各位粉丝度过如梦般的时光，可是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0614_1015_p", "source_sha256": "11c95c3a6e3bf7bdbe5e5930f2371b427ee571fa87bc21289dcdf05f07baa355", "ja": "ははっ、大丈夫だよ。亜利沙が挑戦するというなら、\nそれをサポートするのが、俺の仕事だ。", "zh": "哈哈，没问题。只要亚利沙想挑战，我的工作就是支持她。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0614_1016_p", "source_sha256": "27ba0c33419f6ee243e2907cd995fc53a2d37fd85387066d3c81be5fdd378619", "ja": "だから亜利沙は、一番大切なことを忘れないでくれ。", "zh": "所以，亚利沙，你可别忘了最重要的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0614_1017_028ari", "source_sha256": "6d5e43a481fc94f88a8d9cb5eaf2cb5e99df55b13cbc153db3025037b90bf4a1", "ja": "大切なことですか……？", "zh": "最重要的事情吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0614_1018_p", "source_sha256": "75a1f7e39e4f08ea9cbd4fe49160f259a59bf14da49b9820195613762f3130f1", "ja": "ああ。気負わずに、アイドルを楽しむこと！", "zh": "是啊。不必给自己太大压力，享受偶像活动吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0614_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "33512b1d91afaecca9424b850ba326b9e20a5a71630d48b38feec0c01577944b", "ja": "ハッ！　そうですね……ありさがめいっぱい\n楽しまないと、ファンの人たちにも失礼ですね！", "zh": "哈！确实……要是亚利沙不能尽情享受，那也太失礼了，怎么对得起粉丝们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0614_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "200b15b5ba96d68871075e7b6090d2f3a97e2dd257735fff1d504b40edfeef59", "ja": "{$P$}さんを信じて、テンションを\n上げて！　ありさ、一気に飛び上がっちゃいますよぉ♪", "zh": "相信{$P$}先生，情绪\n高涨起来了！亚利沙要一口气飞上天去啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_028ari0614_1021_p", "source_sha256": "06952cf0fc6eeec676d6674a0f549af11f51cba944bd63d506b2555f6adf23e1", "ja": "（理想の達成は、亜利沙の自信に繋がるはず。これから\nの亜利沙が、どんな景色をみせてくれるのか楽しみだ）", "zh": "（实现理想应该会成为亚利沙自信的源泉。真期待今后的亚利沙会让我们看到怎样的景色。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
